337 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (The current manufacturing landscape is characterized by limited disclosure practices, where brands typically only reveal their top-tier suppliers while obscuring the complex network of subcontractors. This selective transparency masks potentially poor labor conditions and environmental practices throughout the supply chain. To address these challenges, a comprehensive approach is necessary. The implementation of mandatory supplier disclosure requirements would create accountability throughout the entire supply chain. This must be coupled with stricter enforcement of labor and environmental regulations. )
/E (The current manufacturing landscape is characterized by limited disclosure practices, where brands typically only reveal their top-tier suppliers while obscuring the complex network of subcontractors. This selective transparency masks potentially poor labor conditions and environmental practices throughout the supply chain. To address these challenges, a comprehensive approach is necessary. The implementation of mandatory supplier disclosure requirements would create accountability throughout the entire supply chain. This must be coupled with stricter enforcement of labor and environmental regulations. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
