339 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E ( Within the retail sector, the lack of transparency manifests primarily through insufficient supplier data sharing and inadequate consumer information regarding product ethics. A fundamental transformation of retail transparency requires the establishment of mandatory supply chain disclosure protocols. This should be supported by standardized sustainability labeling guidelines that enable consumers to make informed purchasing decisions. The integration of QR-code tracking systems for ethical sourcing verification represents a technological solution that could significantly enhance supply chain visibility and consumer awareness.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
